This is a 24 game where you can use addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, exponents, factorials square rooting, one number rounding... anything! Be creative! Make sure you hide the solutions to the problems and state your difficulty on a scale of three, three being the hardest. By the way, you don't have to hide the problems, just the solutions.

Most important rule: Have fun!!



